sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Inference Client
    participant AsyncProcessor as llm-d-async<br/>Main Process
    participant Gate as BinaryMetricDispatchGate<br/>Flow Control
    participant Prom as Prometheus / GMP<br/>Metrics Source
    participant Queue as Redis/Valkey<br/>Sorted Set Queue
    participant PubSub as Google Cloud Pub/Sub<br/>(Alternative Backend)
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Server<br/>Port 8000/TCP
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP

    Note over AsyncProcessor: Startup
    AsyncProcessor->>K8s: Watch resources<br/>HTTPS/WSS, TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    AsyncProcessor->>OTel: Initialize tracing<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over AsyncProcessor: Health Probes
    K8s->>AsyncProcessor: GET /healthz<br/>Liveness probe (unauthenticated)
    AsyncProcessor-->>K8s: 200 OK
    K8s->>AsyncProcessor: GET /readyz<br/>Readiness probe (unauthenticated)
    AsyncProcessor-->>K8s: 200 OK

    Note over Client,vLLM: Async Inference Request Flow
    Client->>AsyncProcessor: Submit inference request

    AsyncProcessor->>Gate: pipeline.Gate.Apply()
    Gate->>Prom: Query inference_pool_average_queue_size
    alt Queue size == 0
        Prom-->>Gate: queue_size = 0
        Gate-->>AsyncProcessor: Continue (capacity = 1.0)
    else Queue size > 0
        Prom-->>Gate: queue_size > 0
        Gate-->>AsyncProcessor: Refuse (capacity = 0.0)
        AsyncProcessor-->>Client: Request refused (backpressure)
    else Error or missing metrics
        Prom-->>Gate: Error / no data
        Gate-->>AsyncProcessor: Continue (fail-open)
    end

    Note over AsyncProcessor,Queue: Message Queuing (Primary: Redis/Valkey)
    AsyncProcessor->>Queue: Enqueue request<br/>Redis sorted set
    Queue-->>AsyncProcessor: Acknowledged
    AsyncProcessor->>OTel: Trace span: enqueue

    Note over AsyncProcessor,PubSub: Message Queuing (Alternative: Pub/Sub)
    AsyncProcessor->>PubSub: Publish request<br/>Cloud Pub/Sub topic
    PubSub-->>AsyncProcessor: Acknowledged

    Note over vLLM: Model Server Companion
    K8s->>vLLM: GET /health<br/>Liveness probe
    vLLM-->>K8s: 200 OK
    K8s->>vLLM: GET /v1/models<br/>Readiness probe
    vLLM-->>K8s: Model list
